   "text": "zip archives, pipe-delimited text\n6 families linked by MDR_REPORT_KEY:\nmaster, device, patient, text,\ndevice problems, patient problems\n\nhistory: mdrfoithru2025 (23.6 M reports)\nannual: device<year>, foitext<year>\ncurrent year: mdrfoi, device, ...\nmonthly: *add + *change files\n(FDA updates monthly, no fixed day)",
   "originalText": "zip archives, pipe-delimited text\n6 families linked by MDR_REPORT_KEY:\nmaster, device, patient, text,\ndevice problems, patient problems\n\nhistory: mdrfoithru2025 (23.6 M reports)\nannual: device<year>, foitext<year>\ncurrent year: mdrfoi, device, ...\nmonthly: *add + *change files\n(FDA updates monthly, no fixed day)",
