   "text": "1. HEAD: Last-Modified + size unchanged?\n   -> skip, nothing downloaded\n2. download, SHA-256 already known?\n   -> discard the duplicate\n3. land byte for byte, read-only:\n   landing/<family>/<name>/<sha12>/",
   "originalText": "1. HEAD: Last-Modified + size unchanged?\n   -> skip, nothing downloaded\n2. download, SHA-256 already known?\n   -> discard the duplicate\n3. land byte for byte, read-only:\n   landing/<family>/<name>/<sha12>/",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
